# After the designed crash (game/breach.h), on foot: does play stay at 60 fps once you've come
# through the hole, as in a real game (booted on foot it does)? Round 5, ride west into the flicker
# (as breach.steps), the skid to a stop, then up and walking on west, out to the city, a shot every 0.8 s, and
# turned north and south there (the play-test went to 30 fps here: 10111 61, 10758 2499).
# Film it with tests\e2e\film_round.ps1 -Round 5 -Steps breach_walk.steps
wait_boot
skip_prologue
press start
press z
press start
wait 0.5
# Left: face west. C x6: cruise 7 -> 13
press left
press c 6
wait 5
wait 13
shot bw_00_lying
hold up 1
wait 0.3
shot bw_01_up
hold up 0.8
shot bw_02
hold up 0.8
shot bw_03
hold up 0.8
shot bw_04
hold up 0.8
shot bw_05
hold up 0.8
shot bw_06
hold up 0.8
shot bw_07
hold up 0.8
shot bw_08
hold up 0.8
shot bw_09
hold up 0.8
shot bw_10
hold up 0.8
shot bw_11
hold right 0.7
wait 0.3
shot bw_12_north
hold up 0.6
shot bw_13
hold up 0.6
shot bw_14
hold left 1.4
wait 0.3
shot bw_15_south
